# Build context for deploy/*/Dockerfile. Secrets and local data must never
# reach an image: no .env files, no local storage, backups or test output.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.git
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
.local-storage
.local-backups
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
docs
*.log
